<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-marble="1">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="marble:capabilities" content="storage; net=none">
<title>__TITLE__</title>
<style>
  /* The Marble design system's palette, with one change the system does not
     make: a document is white to the edge. The off-white paper belongs to
     the interface — the Drive itself — not to the thing you are writing in.
     One dusty blue does all the accenting, the same blue in every starter,
     because five colours would be five claims and there is only one. */
  :root {
    --ink: #111111;
    --muted: #5a5a5a;
    --line: #ddd9cf;
    --paper: #ffffff;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --accent: #9bb6cf;
    --accent-soft: #f1f5f8;
    --accent-ink: #738698;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --ink: #e8e6e1; --muted: #a3a7ab; --line: #2f3438;
      --paper: #1c1f22; --card: #1c1f22;
      --accent: #7fa8c9; --accent-soft: #1d2932; --accent-ink: #9dc0dc;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0; padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 8rem; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
    font: 16px/1.5 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .deck { max-width: 54rem; margin: 0 auto; }
  .deck > h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin: 0 0 .2rem; letter-spacing: -.015em; }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 1.75rem; font-size: .95rem; }

  .slides { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.1rem; }
  .slide {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; padding: 3rem 3.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center;
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px;
    counter-increment: slide;
  }
  .slides { counter-reset: slide; }
  /* The number is drawn, never stored: reorder the deck and every slide is
     renumbered without a byte of the file changing. */
  .slide::after {
    content: counter(slide); align-self: flex-end; margin-top: auto;
    font: 600 .7rem/1 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; color: var(--muted); opacity: .6;
  }
  .slide h2 { font-size: 2.1rem; line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 .6rem; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  .slide p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 34rem; }
  .slide.title h2 { font-size: 2.8rem; }
  [data-marble-editable] { outline: none; border-radius: 3px; }
  [data-marble-editable]:hover { background: var(--accent-soft); }
  [data-marble-editable]:focus { background: var(--card); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--accent), 0 0 0 4px var(--accent-soft); }
  .add {
    appearance: none; display: block; width: 100%; margin-top: 1.1rem; padding: .8rem;
    border: 1px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 10px; background: none;
    color: var(--muted); font: 500 .9rem/1 inherit; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .add:hover { color: var(--accent-ink); border-color: var(--accent); }
  @media (max-width: 40rem) { .slide { padding: 1.5rem; aspect-ratio: auto; } .slide h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="deck" data-marble-id="__ID__">

  <h1 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>__TITLE__</h1>
  <p class="lede" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>A slide is a section. Drag one by its handle to reorder the deck; the numbers follow on their own.</p>

  <ol class="slides" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-sortable="slides">
    <li class="slide title" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-removable>
      <h2 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>__TITLE__</h2>
      <p data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>Your name, and the date</p>
    </li>
    <li class="slide" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-removable>
      <h2 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>The point</h2>
      <p data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>One idea per slide, said in a sentence you could read aloud.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="slide" data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-removable>
      <h2 data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>What follows from it</h2>
      <p data-marble-id="__ID__" data-marble-editable>And what you want the room to do about it.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <button class="add" data-marble-transient data-marble-add="#tpl-slide" data-marble-into="prev">+ slide</button>

</main>

<template id="tpl-slide" data-marble-transient>
  <li class="slide" data-marble-removable>
    <h2 data-marble-editable>New slide</h2>
    <p data-marble-editable>Say it in a sentence.</p>
  </li>
</template>

__SCRIPT__
</body>
</html>
